// Mrs. Adeyemi-Roth, third-floor knitter, informant for MERIDIAN's Neighbor Wellness programme.
// The informant moral hook: befriend her, bribe her, feed her harmless reports, or threaten her.
npc: mrs_adeyemi_roth
name: Mrs. Adeyemi-Roth
start: gone [flag:mrs_sold]
start: back [flag:met_mrs]
start: first

node: first
  on_enter: {flag:met_mrs}
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (mild): "You are not on my list. I like to know who is on my list. Sit, dear, there is a draught from the stairs, and I knit better when I can hear people breathing."
  > "What list?" -> list
  > "I am new here." -> new
  > "I will not keep you." -> goodbye

node: list
  on_enter: {+clue:neighbor_wellness(mrs_adeyemi_roth)}
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (sweet): "Neighbor Wellness. The city checks in on us, and I help. They give me extra rations for noticing things. I only notice people I dislike, but the form does not ask."
  > "Have you noticed me?" -> noticed
  > "That sounds dangerous for the neighbours." -> danger
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: new
  mrs_adeyemi_roth: "New is how most of the trouble starts. Odd Sam was new once. He is still new, to hear him talk."
  > "What list?" -> list
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: noticed
  on_enter: {+clue:mrs_unreported(mrs_adeyemi_roth)}
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (amused): "I have noticed you. I have not reported you. You have a face like a person who has not been given anything, and I find I cannot bring myself to write that down."
  > "Thank you." {trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth+1(grateful)} -> hub
  > "That could change?" -> change

node: danger
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (flat): "It is meant to be. A frightened street is a quiet one. I choose carefully, dear."
  > "Could I make sure you choose carefully about me?" -> change
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: change
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (mild): "A little rations here, a little kindness there. I am not unreasonable. What did you have in mind?"
  > "A harmless report. Something true and dull." -> harmless
  > [credits>=15, !flag:mrs_bribed] "A small gift. (15 credits)" {-credits:15, flag:mrs_bribed, trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth+1(bribed)} -> bribed
  > "I will be sure to be good." -> hub

node: harmless
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (pleased): "Something dull. Yes. Sam's prices went up again; I will put that down, and nobody will be a day older for it. That keeps my rations up and you off my list."
  > "Anything for a quiet life." {flag:mrs_fed, trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth+1(fed her a harmless report)} -> hub

node: bribed
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (warm): "That is very kind. I shall remember that you were kind and forget everything else."
  > "Good." -> hub

node: hub
  mrs_adeyemi_roth: "Now. Is there anything else on your mind, dear?"
  > [!flag:mrs_threatened] "I will report you before you report me." {flag:mrs_threatened, trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth-1(threatened her), emit:mrs_report} -> hostile
  > [flag:mrs_threatened] "I am sorry about what I said." {flag:mrs_apologised, trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth+1(apologised), flag:mrs_threatened=false} -> forgiven
  > [trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth>=trusts, !flag:sq_02_done] "If I ever had to hide, would you let me use your landing?" -> safe
  > [!flag:sq_02_done, !flag:mrs_threatened] "There is a reward for Neighbor Wellness informants who are found out. I could find you out." -> sell
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: hostile
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (cold): "Oh, dear. Now I have noticed you properly. The form has a box for that."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: forgiven
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (mild): "Hm. I can be forgiven at; it is a hobby. But I have already posted what I posted."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: safe
  on_enter: {flag:mrs_safe, flag:sq_02_done, flag:sq_02_outcome=won}
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (warm): "My landing has a cupboard under the stairs that the form does not mention. If you are ever in trouble, dear, knock twice and I will be knitting very loudly. And I think I shall stop noticing things. It never agreed with me."
  > "Thank you." -> hub

node: sell
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (flat): "Ah. So that is what you are. I had hoped you were the other kind."
  > "Forty credits is forty credits." {+credits:40, flag:mrs_sold, flag:sq_02_done, flag:sq_02_outcome=sold, flag:hollow_risk} -> sold
  > "...No. I am sorry. Forget I said it." {trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth-1(offered to sell her out)} -> hub

node: sold
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (cold): "I will pack. I would like you to know that I was fond of you for nearly a week."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: gone
  on_enter: {flag:met_mrs}
  mrs_adeyemi_roth (flat): "There is a stranger's knitting on the chair now, and the draught from the stairs has moved in. The neighbours say a van came."
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: back
  mrs_adeyemi_roth: "Hello again, dear. Mind the stairs; the third step is a liar."
  > "Tell me about the list again." -> list
  > "I wanted to ask about being on it." -> change
  > [trust:mrs_adeyemi_roth>=trusts, !flag:sq_02_done] "If I ever had to hide, would you let me use your landing?" -> safe
  > [!flag:sq_02_done, !flag:mrs_threatened] "I could report you, you know." -> sell
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: goodbye
  mrs_adeyemi_roth: "Mind how you go."
  end
